{"type":"message","id":"e2fd5d39","parentId":"8cb66ea9","timestamp":"2026-03-29T05:51:21.449Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see from the session history that this session only contains the current conversation about ECHO. The history is truncated and doesn't show previous discussions. \n\nLet me try to look at the transcript file to find older sessions. The transcript path is `/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/7dc17c76-826e-4265-b90a-44056cb943b2.jsonl`. Let me also check if there are other session files that might contain the ECHO discussion.\n\nActually, looking at the timestamps, the session started at 1774763456253 (current time). The history shows only the current conversation. There don't seem to be previous sessions visible.\n\nThe user is frustrated because they think I should know about ECHO from previous discussions, but I genuinely don't have access to that information. This could be because:\n1. The session was reset\n2. Previous sessions are stored differently\n3. The ECHO discussion happened in a different session/chat\n\nLet me try to read the transcript file or check for any memory files that might have ECHO content.","thinkingSignature":"7984c554555d5cdb996682a325f9e22f6d82b3ba917d62a740aa66ef55922ca3"},{"type":"text","text":"抱歉听风，我这边真的查不到之前的 ECHO 讨论记录——session 历史里只有当前对话，看不到更早的内容 😅\n\n可能是 session 重置过，或者讨论发生在别的聊天窗口？\n\n**你能简单说一下 ECHO 是什么吗？** 比如：\n- ECHO 是做语音/人声/音乐方向的项目？\n- 和 OpenClaw 结合想要实现什么场景？\n\n给我 2-3 句话的背景，我马上帮你重新写设计方案 + 搭 React 展示页面 🙌"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":4901,"output":326,"cacheRead":8671,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13898,"cost":{"input":0.0014703,"output":0.00039119999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0005202599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0023817599999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774763467076,"responseId":"0617f0cb0be876bdf835f8badf5649a9"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a1179fa5","parentId":"e2fd5d39","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:01:05.676Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53b84f38fca0ee8f2e5f1b7bee5\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_863283a354081978577fc20760b58802\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 06:01 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_863283a354081978577fc20760b58802\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53b84f38fca0ee8f2e5f1b7bee5]\n听风: ECHO是一个能管理所有权、使用权、衍生权、扩展权（跨平台或场景使用）四权分离的区块链资产协议，并能实现资产交互过程中的自动分润。现在想将其与 OpenClaw 的 AI Agent 生态有机结合，将\"权\"转化为 Agent 能力，既能让agent接入echo资产协议，又能让其他人通过agent使用echo协议，将细分领域高价值技能/知识库的付费/受控使用生态等，设计基于openClaw而优化的AI智能体、链上系统以及其他配套，以促进各细分领域高价值知识、经验在AI(Agents)原生工作方式下的流通。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_3d6a5ed0560847d9ea5deee73534368f\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774764065672}}
{"type":"message","id":"33e8edb0","parentId":"a1179fa5","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:01:59.500Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the context about ECHO. Let me understand:\n\n**ECHO** is a blockchain asset protocol that manages 4 rights separation:\n1. Ownership (所有权)\n2. Usage Rights (使用权)\n3. Derivative Rights (衍生权)\n4. Extension Rights (跨平台/场景使用扩展权)\n\nAnd it implements automatic profit sharing during asset interactions.\n\nThe vision is to combine ECHO with OpenClaw's AI Agent ecosystem:\n- Transform \"rights\" into Agent capabilities\n- Allow agents to access the ECHO asset protocol\n- Allow others to use the ECHO protocol through agents\n- Build a paid/controlled usage ecosystem for high-value skills/knowledge bases in specialized fields\n- Design AI agents, on-chain systems, and other配套设施 optimized for OpenClaw\n- Promote circulation of high-value knowledge and experience in AI-native workflows across specialized domains\n\nSo the project is about creating a marketplace/economy where:\n1. Knowledge, skills, and expertise can be tokenized as assets with clearly defined rights (ownership, usage, derivative, extension)\n2. AI Agents can be the interface/vehicles for accessing and monetizing these assets\n3. Automatic revenue sharing happens when these assets are used\n\nThis is a Web3 + AI Agent convergence project. Cool!\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Write a comprehensive project design document for ECHO × OpenClaw\n2. Think about how to build a showcase React project\n\nLet me design this properly. I'll create:\n1. A project design doc\n2. A React showcase project structure\n\nFor the React showcase, I should create something that:\n- Demonstrates the concept visually\n- Shows how agents work with the ECHO protocol\n- Has a clean, impressive UI\n- Can be used for demos/presentations\n\nLet me think about the architecture:\n\n**ECHO Protocol Core:**\n- Rights Management Engine (四权管理系统)\n- Asset Registration (资产注册)\n- Smart Contract Layer (for on-chain rights tracking)\n\n\n- Revenue Distribution Engine (分润引擎)\n\n**OpenClaw Integration:**\n- ECHO Agent SDK (让 Agent 接入协议)\n- Skill/Knowledge Asset化框架\n- Agent Marketplace (技能/知识市场)\n\n**Key Concepts:**\n- Rights Tokenization: Convert skills/knowledge into tradable assets with clear rights structures\n- Agent as Service Provider: AI agents become the delivery mechanism for monetized expertise\n- Automatic Royalty Distribution: Every time an asset is accessed or used, revenue flows automatically to rights holders\n- Sovereign Knowledge Economy: Domain experts retain ownership while others pay to tap into their knowledge\n\nThe system architecture needs a frontend showcase to visualize the ecosystem, plus the core blockchain infrastructure handling rights verification and payment distribution. Agent nodes execute the actual work while OpenClaw provides the orchestration layer connecting everything together. I'm mapping out the core components needed: rights management for different permission levels, asset registration, transaction handling, revenue distribution, an agent SDK, marketplace, and creator tools. For the showcase itself, I want a landing page explaining the concept, visualizations of how rights and assets work, a marketplace to browse offerings, and demo flows showing what creators and consumers actually experience. Let me start building this as a Next.js project with TypeScript and Tailwind, then write up the full spec.","thinkingSignature":"618cfe03fe5ea92e6d5c127b7a9dbba37518f302212f72ba194e77cc5f4ee794"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！ECHO 的概念很清晰——四权分离的区块链资产协议 + 自动分润 + AI Agent 作为交付载体。这个方向非常有潜力 🔥\n\n我来给你写完整的设计方案，然后搭一个 React 展示项目。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_b6n6x1ik6u37_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"设计并初始化一个 ECHO × OpenClaw 融合项目的展示页面。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n**ECHO 是什么：**\n- 区块链资产协议：管理\"所有权、使用权、衍生权、扩展权\"四权分离\n- 自动分润：资产交互时自动执行分润逻辑\n- 核心场景：将细分领域高价值技能/知识库资产化，实现 AI 原生的付费/受控使用生态\n\n**与 OpenClaw 结合的核心思路：**\n- 将\"权\"转化为 Agent 能力——让 Agent 可以读写链上资产协议\n- 其他用户通过 Agent 使用 ECHO 协议——Agent 成为知识/技能交付的天然载体\n- 建立细分领域高价值知识的 AI-Agent 原生工作方式\n\n## 需要完成的工作\n\n### 1. 创建项目设计文档\n路径：`/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-openclaw/DESIGN.md`\n\n文档结构：\n```\n# ECHO × OpenClaw 融合项目设计\n\n## 1. 项目概述与愿景\n\n## 2. 核心概念\n### 2.1 ECHO 协议四权模型\n### 2.2 Agent as Asset Gateway\n### 2.3 知识作为可编程资产\n\n## 3. 系统架构\n### 3.1 协议层（链上）\n### 3.2 Agent 层（OpenClaw）\n### 3.3 应用层\n\n## 4. 四权通证经济模型\n### 4.1 所有权 ($ECHO)\n### 4.2 使用权（按次/订阅）\n### 4.3 衍生权（二次创作授权）\n### 4.4 扩展权（跨平台/场景）\n\n## 5. OpenClaw Agent 集成设计\n### 5.1 ECHO Agent SDK\n### 5.2 技能资产化框架\n### 5.3 Agent  marketplace\n\n## 6. 分润机制\n### 6.1 实时分润合约逻辑\n### 6.2 多方分润场景\n\n## 7. 典型用例/用户旅程\n\n## 8. 技术选型\n\n## 9. 落地步骤（Roadmap）\n```\n\n### 2. 创建 React 展示项目\n路径：`/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-openclaw/`\n\n项目要求：\n- 基于 Vite + React + TypeScript + TailwindCSS\n- 单页面展示，站内有多个 Section：\n  1. **Hero** - ECHO × OpenClaw 品牌展示，动效吸睛\n  2. **四权模型可视化** - 交互式图表展示所有权/使用权/衍生权/扩展权\n  3. **Agent 工作流** - 展示 Agent 如何接入 ECHO 协议、交付知识资产\n  4. **实时分润模拟器** - 可交互的模拟器，输入金额看分润流向\n  5. **知识资产市场** - 卡片列表展示示例资产（高价值技能/知识库）\n  6. **为什么是 ECHO + OpenClaw** - 两者结合的独特价值\n- 代码要求：组件结构清晰，有适当的动画和交互\n- 部署要求：构建产物在 `dist/` 目录，可直接预览\n\n### 3. 初始化项目\n运行以下命令初始化：\n```bash\nmkdir -p /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-openclaw\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echo-openclaw\nnpm create vite@latest . -- --template react-ts --yes\nnpm install\nnpm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer\nnpx tailwindcss init -p\n```\n\n### 4. 配置文件\n\n**tailwind.config.js** 配置：\n- content 包含 `\"./index.html\", \"./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}\"`\n- 自定义 colors: primary 为紫色系，符合 Web3 风格\n\n**src/index.css** 配置 Tailwind 指令\n\n### 5. 实现所有组件\n在 `src/` 下创建：\n- `App.tsx` - 主入口，多 Section 垂直滚动\n- `components/Hero.tsx` - 品牌 Hero\n- `components/RightsModel.tsx` - 四权可视化\n- `components/AgentWorkflow.tsx` - Agent 工作流\n- `components/ProfitSimulator.tsx` - 分润模拟器\n- `components/Marketplace.tsx` - 知识资产市场\n- `components/WhyEchoOpenClaw.tsx` - 价值主张\n\n### 6. 部署配置\n确保 `vite.config.ts` 配置正确，构建产物输出到 `dist/`\n\n## 完成后\n1. 确认 `ls dist/` 有构建产物\n2. 确认设计文档 `DESIGN.md` 内容完整\n3. 回复简要说明完成的内容\n\n","label":"echo-openclaw-design","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10,"output":1787,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":13939,"totalTokens":15736,"cost":{"input":0.000003,"output":0.0021444,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.005227125,"total":0.007374525}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774764065676,"responseId":"0617f3221ff25efb15097d65c74b0817"}}
